{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "92cc7c3c5eb7052833349825d865ac02081cbf1a241f322079eb2ed31a027df4", "ja": "（今日は、朋花が初めてステージに立つ。\n朋花のことだし、大丈夫だろうとは思うけど……）", "zh": "（今天是朋花第一次登上舞台的日子。\n毕竟是朋花，我想应该没问题吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "12a92ea03bc0255475d6aaa53e33bda30db02a6416dbcbf3a6ff4c5990347eb4", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "b0b53781bfb56cd82018efee5201c1e058c68290339d29800c885f09f2dedf64", "ja": "さっきから、何だか難しい顔をして……\nもしかして、緊張しているのですか～？", "zh": "你从刚才开始就一副心事重重的样子……\n该不会在紧张吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "98c73daba4eccd163e90d5ebbe24468df20219a9c7ed26ec575e938bf8216cea", "ja": "緊張……まあ、ある意味そうかな。\n肝心の朋花はどうなんだ？", "zh": "紧张……也算吧。\n最关键的朋花本人又如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "d2af51b24eee09993cec423562e7844c24eaaf1e27415dd1edbe62898d842c31", "ja": "私が、どうかしましたか～？", "zh": "你说我怎样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a44a94d9071c7d8f7050a260315d2f9f9dfe6dc53cccd5578dc70c6d1a06326c", "ja": "……いつもどおりみたいだな。\n緊張してないのか？", "zh": "……看来你跟平常一样呢。\n你不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "0f502c3f115a9df567e7e1fb250a6070f17a3bf3e686312f919aaae4ec1939e1", "ja": "愚問ですね～♪　子豚ちゃん達を導く晴れ舞台で、\nどうして緊張する必要があるのですか～？", "zh": "真是傻问题～♪这是引领小猪们的重要表演，\n为什么需要紧张～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "c2090463cdcf53f706a14e6e4f045c88e855e40fbb3e7851b2cfb69ba7d86911", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達を導き、笑顔にする。\nそれが、私の生き甲斐なのですよ～♪", "zh": "引领小猪们、带给他们笑容，\n这就是我的生存意义喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f4a49da323bd810643d2f631e0a4c13cd706a8633082e89463449c1e56a6a6c8", "ja": "ならいいんだ。でも、何か不安になったり……\n心配なことがあったら、すぐに言ってほしい。", "zh": "那就好。但要是你感到不安……\n或有担心的地方，记得马上告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "b49e69d9a261535313dcf7983137fec0be2130e172d80d09a94f8c3524baadae", "ja": "大丈夫です～♪\n何もありません～。", "zh": "没事的～♪\n没有任何问题～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b3c6b53be9aeb1de540c0d02d14ba9eb77c89f9417336f71bc58b7e717783f80", "ja": "本当か？\nプロデューサーの俺には、何も隠さなくていいんだぞ？", "zh": "真的吗？\n对于我这个制作人，用不着有所隐藏喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "c7578de47a15822fb51993d1037bc96c74c638ff943dcc18417638e97fa627a3", "ja": "そんなに、心配そうな顔をしないでください。\n私の方が不安になってしまいます～。", "zh": "请别露出那么担心的表情，\n这样反而会让我不安的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2f826de7c3ccb680fea8d8ef05102b799205418dc6da78f7945734380e86863a", "ja": "あっ……すまない。", "zh": "啊……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "45bd5b22b2a92b66fa1e7dab8b07da05425a04a4ba82a52f2d389fd0893d75f7", "ja": "でもいくら落ち着いていても、朋花はまだ15歳だし。\n大丈夫って言われても、心配なんだ。", "zh": "虽说个性稳重，但朋花才15岁。\n就算你说没事，我还是会担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "5fa2d701a5eb361b8de6381e1d4d4a5230f345788e412038c7155b48d7ade4a5", "ja": "うふふ……{$P$}さんは、\n本当におかしな人ですね～♪", "zh": "呵呵……{$P$}先生，\n你真的是个奇怪的人呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "dc67f449c4f6ea1a639927c8eb03871ef08f4a177e7816d779988a786b3e7d51", "ja": "この私を……子豚ちゃん達の聖母を、\nまるで普通の子のように扱うなんて～。", "zh": "居然把我……把小猪们的圣母\n当成一般女孩子看待～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a716cbf63e4e41e9029fa16b414e7a926e58d1aefdb45b7444bc0897036e45a4", "ja": "自分のアイドルが初公演なんだし、心配するのは\n当然だと思うけどな。それに……。", "zh": "这是自家偶像的首次公演，\n当然会担心呀。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "e504e62ff427d5a42d642dc530a8cb62036fdb38068d1d40963153eb178feb6d", "ja": "それに？", "zh": "而且？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4ac1a41700ad59ac21902eda25a5fdb34858dbbbb3efac4de602c935d88d3d6b", "ja": "朋花は、ファンの期待に応えようとしてる。なら俺も、\nプロデューサーとして朋花の期待に応えたい。", "zh": "朋花想回应粉丝的期待。\n那么我身为制作人，也想回应朋花的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9c8523286090330556106aa1a72c3e74fb591a25d920ae05baafbd19a9d02fa5", "ja": "ん？\n何か変なこと言ったか？", "zh": "嗯？\n我说了什么奇怪的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "e41ef5097c69f29c9cdfea2631b088bebc213461b9602343531be78f8740387a", "ja": "ええ。やっぱり{$P$}さんは、\nおかしな人ですね～。", "zh": "是啊。{$P$}先生\n果然是个奇怪的人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c97c273b898471d5cb547f6a793a40775737cd982f2a34d74970db2b703fc7c", "ja": "でも、そういうのも悪くありませんよ～。\nその決意通り、私をしっかり支えてくださいね～。", "zh": "不过这样也不坏～\n你就按照那份决心，尽力支持我吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4723c3ba896b42b6fc5302402f52deac079a1e2ec2496861aa444286e56e840c", "ja": "もちろん、全力でサポートするよ。\n朋花、頑張れ！", "zh": "那当然，我会全力支持你的。\n朋花，要加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "6bf61dfcc74c07954ba7fbe4638aab74e865070dc173bd6c4b90f129406a76f1", "ja": "うふふ、当然ですよ～♪　では……\nそろそろ出番のようですので、行ってきますね～。", "zh": "呵呵，我当然会加油～♪\n那么……看来似乎轮到我出场了，我先走啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8c98a0a65f227257d45863ac9eb105fc930a029f898ea616e7d5ba0caebb470c", "ja": "（笑顔でそう言い残して、\n朋花はステージへと向かっていった）", "zh": "（朋花笑着说完这句话，\n便走向了舞台。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_031tom_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_031tom_003_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d362f4016db1a0dc99d1fc3d0b609ad30ca532847f7410fa3b70897868f84839", "ja": "（朋花のデビューを飾るステージ……\nその姿はきっと、観客の目に焼き付くだろう！）", "zh": "（朋花的出道表演……\n她的身影一定会深深烙印在观众们眼底吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
